# The site is a static export with PHP form endpoints, so there are almost no
# environment variables left. Anything referenced here is inlined at BUILD time
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) — there is no server process to read env vars at runtime.
#
# Mail configuration is NOT here. The contact and newsletter endpoints are PHP
# and read their settings from deploy/api/config.php, which is deployed to the
# server. There is no API key: mail is handed to the local MTA on the same
# cPanel account that receives it.

# --- Booking (optional) --------------------------------------------------
# Cal.com path only, no domain — e.g. "xark/intro" renders a link to
# https://cal.com/xark/intro. Leave empty and BookingLink renders nothing
# rather than pointing at an account that doesn't exist.
#
# Because this is inlined at build time, changing it means rebuilding and
# re-uploading — it cannot be set on the server.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CAL_LINK=
